<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Engelhard started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Engelhard started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it started coverage of Engelhard Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimates 1997 earnings at $1.20 per share, 1998 at $1.40.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month target price of $26 per share, representing 18 percent appreciation over next 12 months.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 22-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
